  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "7pdRMmj7Dl01fkaLWejnn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -181,
      "y": 211,
      "width": 762.1803279903022,
      "height": 593,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 130727176,
      "version": 1596,
      "versionNonce": 1845022545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763839957789,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "J2E or JEE (Java Enterprise Edition Code)\n\nHad more issues\nJDBC (Java Database Connection) and ORM\nDeployment Issues, Repeated Code (Tightly Coupled)\nWhich used to take 2 months for configuration for production project\n\n\n\nSo Spring Framework came to rescue which helped in Auto Configuration , Dependency Injection.\n\nWe will be learning on Spring Framework first;\nSpring Ecosystem:\n\nSpring Framework\nSpring Boot (Auto Configuration)\nSpring Cloud (For Creating Micro Services)\nSpring Data ( Connecting to Database)\nSpring Authentication (Security code)\nSpring Kafka \nSpring Integration\nSpring Security\nSpring Statemachine\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 16.3586206896552,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "J2E or JEE (Java Enterprise Edition Code)\n\nHad more issues\nJDBC (Java Database Connection) and ORM\nDeployment Issues, Repeated Code (Tightly Coupled)\nWhich used to take 2 months for configuration for production project\n\n\n\nSo Spring Framework came to rescue which helped in Auto Configuration , Dependency Injection.\n\nWe will be learning on Spring Framework first;\nSpring Ecosystem:\n\nSpring Framework\nSpring Boot (Auto Configuration)\nSpring Cloud (For Creating Micro Services)\nSpring Data ( Connecting to Database)\nSpring Authentication (Security code)\nSpring Kafka \nSpring Integration\nSpring Security\nSpring Statemachine\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GHyCTKAQnv0BepmG5UHMo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 638,
      "y": 207,
      "width": 546.2395629882812,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1223202680,
      "version": 308,
      "versionNonce": 681456607,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1763840178232,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Bean\n\nA Spring Bean is simply a Java object created by Spring,\nnot by you.\n\nThis is how we define object without spring\n\nCar car = new Car();\n\npublic class Payment {\n    public void pay(){\n        System.out.println(\"Paying....\");\n    }\n}\n\n\nPayment paymentObj = new Payment();\n paymentObj.pay();\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bean\n\nA Spring Bean is simply a Java object created by Spring,\nnot by you.\n\nThis is how we define object without spring\n\nCar car = new Car();\n\npublic class Payment {\n    public void pay(){\n        System.out.println(\"Paying....\");\n    }\n}\n\n\nPayment paymentObj = new Payment();\n paymentObj.pay();\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
