      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763841073890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When does it run?\n\nIt runs right after the bean is created \nand dependencies are injected, before the bean is used.\n\n@Component\npublic class PaymentService {\n\n    @PostConstruct\n    public void init() {\n        System.out.println(\"PaymentService initialized\");\n    }\n}\n",
      "fontSize": 13.466666666666688,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When does it run?\n\nIt runs right after the bean is created \nand dependencies are injected, before the bean is used.\n\n@Component\npublic class PaymentService {\n\n    @PostConstruct\n    public void init() {\n        System.out.println(\"PaymentService initialized\");\n    }\n}\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
